[{"speaker":"","text":"果然不行。感觉完全睡不着……","art":{"background":"a2572","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"从我脑海中闪过的，是有地壁咚我的时候，他脸上的表情。","art":{"background":"a2572","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"是他向我表白，对我说“喜欢你”的声音。","art":{"background":"a2572","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"还有……接吻的时候感受到的，他嘴唇的温暖……","art":{"background":"a2572","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「光是回想一下……身体里就开始燥热了」","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"热成这样怎么睡得着啊。","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"明天还要早起的，可我却……","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"胸口、脑袋、全身都很热……就算闭上眼睛，也完全感觉不到困意。","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"反而更加清晰地感受到了身体的燥热……心脏通通直跳……","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（这就是恋爱……自己无法抑制住的感情……）」","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"唉，果然我比自己想象的要下流得多……","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且，还不擅长忍耐。","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（我现在在芳乃大人的房间里。而且，芳乃大人就睡在旁边。我不能做奇怪的事，要老老实实睡觉才行……）」","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我明明知道这些……可我实在太想解决这份燥热的欲望了，于是手不由自主地就——","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯！？嗯……嗯嗯、呼……呼……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我是第一次……这样触摸自己的身体……","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"意料之外的刺激差点让我叫了出来，我拼命把声音压抑住。","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是呼吸也因此变得急促……","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呼……呼……哈啊啊……」","art":{"background":"a2575","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"芳乃大人没醒。她只要睡着了就会睡得很沉，就算我呼吸变得急促一点应该也不会被发现。","art":{"background":"a2575","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是以防万一，还是要像正常睡觉时一样呼吸……","art":{"background":"a2575","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊……啊、啊、啊、啊……哈啊、嗯、嗯……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2576","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"呼吸……正常呼吸……","art":{"background":"a2576","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯、嗯、嗯嗯……嗯、嗯呼啊、哈啊、哈啊、嗯……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊啊，不行。无论我怎么克制，呼吸还是变得断断续续，声音也凌乱了起来。","art":{"background":"a2574","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（明明知道不能这么做……啊啊，不行了……手停不下来）」","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"强忍着的燥热，转化为了咕啾咕啾的声音。","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"手指上沾满的粘液散发着我从未感受到过的热量。","art":{"background":"a2573","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呜啊……粘乎乎的，我从来没这么……哈啊、哈啊啊……嗯、嗯、嗯……嗯嗯————嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2577","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（啊啊，好厉害。粘乎乎的蜜汁……停不下来。这种感觉是第一次……啊啊）」","art":{"background":"a2578","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……嗯啊、嗯、呜呜呜……声音、憋不住了……唔唔」","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"明明是要解决这股燥热才这么做的……可是完全没用。","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"越用手指去摩擦……身体反而越发燥热。","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯……唔唔……嗯、嗯嗯、嗯嗯——————」","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（这……怎么可能睡得着。头脑好像要变得不正常了……呜）」","art":{"background":"a2578","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、啊、啊、啊……嗯、嗯啊、嗯嗯……嗯、嗯嗯……！」","art":{"background":"a2577","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"身体上的炙热几乎要让大脑陷入一片空白……","art":{"background":"a2577","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（怎么蹭都没用……不对，越蹭身体越热……）」","art":{"background":"a2580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……哈啊啊啊……嗯、嗯嗯————」","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（啊啊……不行了，手指停不下来。既然已经这样了，干脆……）」","art":{"background":"a2580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我加快了手指摩擦的速度。","art":{"background":"a2580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"摸到我满足为止吧。","art":{"background":"a2580","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唔唔——唔唔——嗯嗯嗯嗯……嗯啊、嗯、嗯嗯嗯、呼啊啊……啊、啊啊啊……」","art":{"background":"a2581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我用指尖温柔地，认真地勾勒。","art":{"background":"a2581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后对着最敏感的阴蒂一阵搓弄——","art":{"background":"a2581","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呀！啊啊！嗯、嗯嗯————！嗯啊啊、哈啊、哈啊……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（啊啊，刚才的感觉好强烈……又差点叫出声了）」","art":{"background":"a2578","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊……有、有地……嗯嗯！嗯呀啊！」","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"一边想着有地一边抚摸，感觉更加强烈了。","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊啊……粘乎乎的液体止都止不住。像尿床一样，不停地淌出来。","art":{"background":"a2579","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈呀、啊、啊、啊啊啊……嗯嗯、嗯嗯啊……」","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「声音……声音……嗯、啊……啊啊啊啊……要叫出来了……要被芳乃大人，听到了……嗯嗯、她没醒吧」","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我拼命地忍受着快感，压抑着叫声。","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但我的手指却与意识相悖，完全没有停下来。","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一心一意地抚摸着自己，仿佛要把湿透了的内裤变得更湿。","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"忍不住想把内裤脱了……啊，可是脱了的话，床单也会湿的……","art":{"background":"a2583","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（绝对不能把床单弄脏……可是、可是……啊啊，手停不下来。这也太舒服了……）」","art":{"background":"a2584","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯、呀啊啊……哈啊、哈啊……嗯、嗯嗯……要、忍住才行、忍住、忍住……嗯、嗯嗯……！」","art":{"background":"a2585","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（我太下流太不知羞耻了……明明芳乃大人就在旁边，还做这种事……）」","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一边对无法忍耐的自己感到羞耻，一边又因为担心被发现而心跳加速……","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"怎么办……只是想象了一下就变得更湿了。","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊啊，简直就像体内的保险栓被拔掉了一样……","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这……怎么可能忍得住……","art":{"background":"a2582","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唔唔——唔唔——嗯、嗯、嗯嗯……嗯啊、啊啊、呜呜呜呜呜……」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呜啊、哈啊、哈啊……必须赶紧、赶紧弄到高潮……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"那里变得越来越热，从刚才开始就一直在发出响亮的“咕啾咕啾”的声音。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种声音，要是被芳乃大人听到的话……啊啊，可是我真的停不下来。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（啊啊，还要……还要……我还想要。再舒服点……对不起，对不起我太下流了）」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"刚刚只是在搓弄阴蒂。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"现在我多用了几根手指，轻轻地将皮拨开……阴核就一下子冒了出来。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、哈啊、哈啊……把阴蒂剥开了……这样的话，就能马上高、高潮了」","art":{"background":"a2587","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊、哈啊哈啊哈啊、嗯……嗯嗯啊啊啊——————！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「这个不行，太厉害了……太厉害了……意识要、哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我根据学到的知识第一次剥开了阴蒂。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"没想到只是稍微碰了一下就全身一片酥麻……","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"实在是太敏感了，随便乱碰的话……可能会因为搓得太用力而产生疼痛……","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、哈啊……先、先轻轻地碰……唔——唔——嗯、嗯嗯嗯……」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"把手指放上去。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"光是把手指放上去，全身就像有电流窜过一样猛然一震，粘液像是被挤出来一样从阴道里飙了出来。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈呀、哈、哈啊……哈啊……啊、这样、就能……哈啊、哈啊……」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（接下来别太用力，用手指轻轻碰一碰就行——）」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「呀、啊！啊！啊啊啊、嗯嗯、嗯嗯嗯—————！唔唔、唔唔、唔唔、嗯、嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"不行，这样弄……全身真的要麻痹了。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（这个、太爽了……啊啊啊、要是上瘾了就麻烦了……可是，这么爽，也忍不住……）」","art":{"background":"a2589","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、啊、啊呀！嗯、嗯啊啊啊……哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……啊啊啊啊啊……嗯嗯！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"搓弄……再搓弄……","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"每次震动阴蒂时，就会有让人忍受不住的快感袭来。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"身体使不上劲……啊啊，忍不住要叫出声音来了。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"可是、可是……都已经这样了，怎么可能停下来……","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊啊啊啊啊，要快点……快点，高潮才行……哈啊、哈啊……嗯、嗯嗯嗯嗯——————……！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唔唔——嗯、嗯……嗯嗯啊啊、哈啊、哈啊、还差一点……啊啊啊啊、嗯、嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我已经陷入狂乱之中，甚至觉得这副身体已不属于自己。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"快感强烈到怀疑自己的大脑是不是已经融化了……","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯啊啊、哈啊、哈啊……啊啊、太爽了……本来阴蒂就已经很酥麻了，剥开之后居然这么……啊啊啊呜！」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯——呜、哈、哈啊、哈啊……啊、啊、啊啊、我的身体、变得、变得好色了……」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、啊啊、啊、嗯嗯啊啊……不行、啊啊、不行了、要去了……」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"手指的振动经由阴蒂，变为电流流过全身。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我已经无法思考阴蒂的快感之外的任何事了。在一心一意抖动手指的过程中——","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「啊、啊、啊、去了去了、要去了……呜、嗯嗯、嗯嗯————————————————！！」","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"某种东西在体内一闪而过，让我眼前一片空白。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"腿和腰剧烈抖动着，身体轻飘飘的，像是浮在了空中。","art":{"background":"a2588","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯啊、哈啊——、哈啊——哈啊啊啊……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"轻飘飘的感觉笼罩了我的全身。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这就是……高潮……？我，高潮了吗……？","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"感受到绝妙快感的同时，心底里涌出对自己的厌恶。","art":{"background":"a2586","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（居、居然真的自慰了……在芳乃大人的房间，在芳乃大人身边……）」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（一开始还以为稍微碰一碰就能满足了……居然自慰到高潮了）」","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且是在别人给我的被褥上。","art":{"background":"a2590","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「芳乃大人……还在睡。太好了……啊、嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2591","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"明明刚才还那么燥热，现在已经冷却下来了。","art":{"background":"a2591","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"唉……而且内裤也湿透了……","art":{"background":"a2591","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然安抚了身体，但这样的话又会因为另一种原因睡不着吧……","art":{"background":"a2591","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唉……顺便再去浴室洗个澡吧」","art":{"background":"a2591","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我拿好要换的衣服便走出了房间。","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"………………","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"…………","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"……","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……茉、茉子她……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a1610","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「茉子她，发出了奇怪的声音……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a833","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「刚才一直背对她，下意识地觉得不能去看……莫非刚刚的就是，自、自慰……？而且——」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a842","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「剥开栗子（阴蒂）……剥栗子？那到底是什么意思，是某种比喻吗？还是说……茉子做了我不知道的事……」","art":{"background":"a1331","sprites":[{"asset":"a2592","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「茉子变下流了——！」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……嗯？总觉得刚刚好像，听到了芳乃大人的声音……？」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2564","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不，应该是错觉吧，错觉」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2593","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"毕竟她睡得那么熟。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2593","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"怎么可能喊出这么大的声音嘛。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2593","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且，如果刚刚真的是芳乃大人在喊的话——","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2593","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那、那就说明她发现了我在自慰……这，不会的不会的，啊哈哈，哈哈……」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2594","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"真、真的没问题吧？我后知后觉地担心了起来。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2594","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「为什么会像这样，为什么在做过之后才后悔不安呢」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2595","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唉……不该自慰的不该自慰的不该自慰的不该自慰的啊啊啊……」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2566","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"要是在被子里忍住的话就不用这么痛苦了。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2566","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"可是，已经无法挽回了……事已经做了，现在只能祈祷没有被芳乃大人发现了……","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2566","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「可是我自己也吓了一跳，我居然会这么大胆……」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2596","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这就是……恋爱……","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2597","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这恋爱可能比我在漫画上看到的更色情。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2597","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是……这就是我的初恋……","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2597","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「恋爱……初恋……嘿嘿嘿……我现在在谈恋爱啊，哈哈」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2598","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"是因为至今为止一直在忍耐的缘故吗？","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2598","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"能感受到心动不已的感觉，就让我非常高兴了。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2598","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且最重要的是，我有喜欢的人。而且我喜欢的人也喜欢我。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2598","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"单是这一点，就让我感受到了从未有过的幸福感。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2598","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「毫无疑问，我现在就是在恋爱」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2599","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是，在幸福之中也夹杂着一丝不安。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2599","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「如果这样也不行的话……到底要怎么做，才能让兽灵满足呢？」","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[{"asset":"a2600","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我无法忽视这一点。","art":{"background":"a473","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"抱着这份不安，我又钻进了被窝。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯、嗯呜呜……啊，已经早上了……？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a242","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「果然睡了回笼觉就会起晚……要赶紧起来，换好衣服……去打扫浴室才行」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1710","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……咦？我怎么在正殿里？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a280","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我记得昨天……自慰之后，去洗了个澡，然后回芳乃大人的房间睡觉了才对。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"可是……为什么？感觉有点奇怪……","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我没能理解眼前的状况，歪了歪头。就在此时，我感受到了一股诡异的气息，于是立刻进入了备战姿势。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"然而——","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（——糟了，没带苦无）」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a2601","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"当我正为了自己手无寸铁而感到不安时，它出现在了我面前。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a2601","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「祟神……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"它的样子就跟之前在山里看到的无数崇神的集合体一样。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是，和之前不一样的是……它完全没有要发动袭击的样子。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"它只是盯着我，就像在对我进行评估。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「（祟神为什么会在这时候出来……？）」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『这就是——』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「——！？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a631","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这不是声音。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"和声音不一样，感觉是在直接和我的大脑对话一样——","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"和我被附身的时候一样的感觉。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『这就是喜欢上一个人的感觉吗』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a791","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这个兽灵还真是想了解恋爱这种感情……？","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a791","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「是、是的。这就是爱上一个人的感觉」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『明明拥有这么温暖的感情……你们却……』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a321","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「什么意思？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a279","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我要把你诅咒至死』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a279","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「为什么……选择了我？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『废话，当然是因为你身上流着那个残酷的男人的血』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我绝对不会原谅那个男人。他做了不可原谅之事』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「但是……这样的话，你就会失去喜欢上他人的感情」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『这不关我事』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你附在我身上，不是为了把我诅咒至死吧」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1106","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"如果它真的要这么做，我早就该死了。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1106","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1106","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「而且你附到我身上的时候，对我“想谈恋爱”的感情产生了反应」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a280","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「看来你是出于某种原因才想了解这种感情的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a318","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你想说什么？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a318","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我觉得你就算杀了我，也不会得到满足」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a565","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那干脆实现你的目的就好了吧？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a320","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你觉得我会按你说的做？』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a320","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不知道，但是至少你在和我交流」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a320","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我以前一直以为你毫无理智可言，无法和人交流……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a242","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『………』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a242","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你作为那个残酷男人的后代，倒是相当理性啊』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a242","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「也不能这么说。我一直都在强作镇定」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a332","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「因为我绝对不能死」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a320","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『自己的命还是最重要的啊』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"出","x":180,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":0.0,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a320","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「当然了。因为……有地说了，他希望我能和他在一起」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a977","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我希望我喜欢的人能够笑容常在。因为他的笑容，能给我带来幸福」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a331","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「所以为了喜欢的人的笑容，我不能死」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1716","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"祖先为了自己的私欲，砍下了它的头，在那之后还逼它作恶……","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"我确实能理解它对我们一族的憎恨。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"可即便如此，我……也已经无法放弃了。因为我知道了我真正的心意。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『……你真的和那个男人不一样』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-27.272727272727266,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我的祖先……是什么样的人？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a550","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『那家伙丑恶不堪，自私自利恩将仇报……不，他甚至不把别人给予他的恩情当恩情看，真是个卑鄙无耻的男人』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-11.111111111111114,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『而你却说要为了喜欢的人而活』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-11.111111111111114,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我想了解这种感情』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-11.111111111111114,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我想知道……那位大人留给我的话究竟是什么意思。但是，凭我现在这副身体……已经无法实现了』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-11.111111111111114,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那位大人……？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a959","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"突然，视野中出现一阵干扰。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『请不要这么做……区区凡人，区区凡人的命运随他去就是了！』","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『而且，那个男人还背叛了姐姐大人』","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"「可姐姐大人……你却要为他做到这个地步，我……！我真的无法理解……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『如果有朝一日你也有了喜欢的人，你就会明白的』","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这……？莫非是兽灵的记忆？","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"“想谈恋爱”、“想喜欢上某个人”的理由……到底是什么呢？","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『我就姑且信你一次吧。作为代价，你要交出一样东西来赎回你的性命』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『如果你肯交出来，我也可以让你不再变成狗』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「真、真的吗！？那可真是太感谢了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a281","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「一直提心吊胆的对心脏也不好……而且就因为这个，我一直不敢和我喜欢的人亲热」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1168","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那么，我要把什么东西交给你呢？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a631","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"},{"speaker":"野兽","text":"『你要把你的“心意”交给我』","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1388","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-20.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-1"}]